
# SideHustle AI — Product Listing Studio

## About the Project

SideHustle AI is a browser-based tool that helps small business owners,
Instagram sellers, handmade-product creators and resellers create
product listings quickly.

It generates product titles, descriptions, search tags and social
media captions from basic product details.

## Features

- Product information form
- AI-assisted product descriptions
- Product title and search tags
- Social media captions
- Copy-to-clipboard buttons
- Responsive website design
- Open-weight AI model in the browser
- No paid AI API key required
- Local template fallback if the model fails

## Technologies Used

- HTML
- CSS
- JavaScript
- Hugging Face Transformers.js
- Xenova/flan-t5-small open-weight model

## How to Run

1. Download or clone the repository.
2. Open the project folder in VS Code.
3. Install the Live Server extension.
4. Right-click index.html.
5. Select Open with Live Server.
6. Enter product information and generate a listing.

The model and JavaScript library require an internet connection
for their initial download.

## How Open-Source AI Is Used

The project uses Transformers.js to run the Xenova/flan-t5-small
text-to-text model in the browser.

Product details are processed in the browser rather than sent
to a custom application server or paid AI API.

If the model fails to load, a JavaScript template provides
a fallback. Results in fallback mode are not AI-generated.

## Why Open Innovation Matters

Open-weight models give small businesses and developers more
control over their AI tools.

This project avoids requiring a paid AI API key, supports
experimentation with alternative models and keeps product
details away from a custom application backend.

The current prototype still needs internet for the initial
model download, and all generated content should be reviewed.

## Future Improvements

- Save product listings
- Add more languages
- Add custom brand styles
- Add seller-specific templates
- Collect feedback from real small business owners

## Challenge

Built for the Side Hustle theme of the
Hacktoberfest Open-Source AI Challenge.
